{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18570","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战武牢，动河朔。\n逆之助，图掎角。\n怒鷇麛，抗乔岳。\n翘萌牙，傲霜雹。\n王谋内定，申掌握。\n铺施芟夷，二主缚。\n惮华戎，廓封略。\n命之瞢，卑以斮。\n归有德，唯先觉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}